hadiths[66]{hadithnumber,text}:
"520","Yahya related to me from Malik from Jafar ibn Muhammad from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"521","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ayyub ibn Abi Tamima as- Sakhtayani from Muhammad ibn Sirin that Umm Atiyya al-Ansariyya said"
"524","Hadith Translation Not Available"
"525","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said that he had heard that when Abu Bakr as-Siddiq was ill he asked A'isha"
"526","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Humayd ibn Abdar-Rahman ibn Awf that Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As said"
"527","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that the Messenger of Allah"
"528","Yahya related to me from Muhammad ibn alMunkadir that Rabia ibn Abdullah ibn alHadir told him that he had seen Umar ibn al-Khattab leading people in front of the bier at the funeral of Zaynab bint Jahsh"
"529","Yahya related to me from Malik that Hisham ibn Urwa said"
"530","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said"
"531","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that Asma bint Abi Bakr said to her family"
"532","Yahya related to me from Malik from Said ibn Abi Said al-Maqburi that Abu Hurayra forbade anyone to follow him with a burning torch after his death. Yahya said"
"533","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"534","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Abu Umama ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf told him that once a poor woman fell ill and the Messenger of Allah"
"535","Yahya related to me that Malik asked Ibn Shihab about a man who caught some of the takbirs said over the corpse and missed the rest"
"536","Yahya related to me from Malik from Said ibn Abi Said al-Maqburi from his father that he had asked Abu Hurayra"
"537","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said that he heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"538","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used not to recite when praying over a dead person"
"539","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Abi Harmala"
"540","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"541","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'n Nadr"
"542","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"543","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Uthman ibn Affan and Abdullah ibn Umar and Abu Hurayra used to pray over the dead"
"544","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar"
"545","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to say"
"546","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"547","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said"
"548","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umm Salama"
"549","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that A'isha"
"550","Yahya related to me from Malik from more than one reliable source that Sad ibn Abi Waqqas and Said ibn Zayd ibn Amr ibn Nufayl died at al-Aqiq and were carried to Madina and buried there"
"551","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said"
"552","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Wafid ibn Amr ibn Said ibn Muadh from Nafi ibn Jubayr ibn Mutim from Masud ibn al-Hakam from AIi ibn Abi Talib that the Messenger of Allah"
"553","ahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that AIi ibn Abi Talib used to rest his head on graves and lie on them. Malik said"
"554","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu Bakr ibn Uthman ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf that he had heard Abu Umama ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf say"
"555","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abdullah ibn Jabir ibn Atik that Atik ibn al-Harith"
"556","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr from his father that Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman told him that she had heard A'isha"
"557","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"558","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr ibn Amr ibn Hazm from his father from Abu'n-Nadr as-Salami that the Messenger of Allah"
"559","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard from Abu'l-Hubab Said ibn Yasar from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"560","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim ibn Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr that the Messenger of Allah"
"561","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman from Umm Salama"
"562","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad said"
"563","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu'r-Rijal Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman heard his mother Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman say"
"564","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that A'isha"
"565","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from Abbad ibn Abdullah ibn az-Zubayr that A'isha"
"566","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that A'isha said"
"567","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said that the Messenger of Allah"
"568","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"569","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Abd ar-Rahman ibn Kab ibn Malik al-Ansari told him that his father"
"570","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"571","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"572","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"573","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"574","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Halhalaad-Dili from Mabad ibn Kab ibn Malik that Abu Qatada ibn Ribi used to relate that a funeral procession passed by the Messenger of Allah"
"575","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu'n Nadr"
"576","Malik related to me from AIqama ibn Abi Alqama that his mother said that she had heard A'isha"
"577","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abu Hurayra said"
"578","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amr ibn Yahya al-Mazini that his father said that he had heard Abu Said al-Khudri say that the Messenger of Allah"
"579","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abd arRahman ibn Abi Sasaca al-Ansari from al-Mazini from his father from Abu Said al-Khudri that the Messenger of Allah"
"580","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz wrote to his governor in Damascus about zakat saying"
"581","Yahya related to me from Malik that Muhammad ibn Uqba"
"582","Yahya related to me from Malik from Urwa ibn Husayn from A'isha bint Qudama that her father said"
"583","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to say"
"584","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said"
"585","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman from more than one source that the Messenger of Allah"
"586","Malik said"
"587","Malik said"